Package: ggcorn
Title: Corn Cobs as Bars in 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.13.1
Authors@R:
    person("Bruce", "Gélinas", , "bruce.gelinas@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adds a geom_cob() layer to 'ggplot2' that draws each corn yield value
    as a cob with kernels, a tapered tip and husks, in the manner of geom_col().
    Kernel size can show thousand-kernel weight, the tip can show unpollinated
    kernels, and the cob can carry common smut galls or western bean cutworm
    damage. Includes palettes to color kernels by yield, disease severity or
    type of ear rot.
